  "content": {
    "id": "p12-q12-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "12",
    "prompt": "Given that $m\\propto\\frac{1}{n^2}$, what is the effect on:",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p12-q12-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$m$ when $n$ is doubled?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$m$ is divided by $4$.",
          "worked": "Write $m=\\frac{k}{n^2}$. When $n$ becomes $2n$,\n$$\\begin{align*}m_{\\text{new}}&=\\frac{k}{(2n)^2}\\\\m_{\\text{new}}&=\\frac14\\frac{k}{n^2}\\\\m_{\\text{new}}&=\\frac m4.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 22
      },
      {
        "id": "p12-q12-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$m$ when $n$ is halved?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$m$ is multiplied by $4$.",
          "worked": "Write $m=\\frac{k}{n^2}$. When $n$ becomes $\\frac n2$,\n$$\\begin{align*}m_{\\text{new}}&=\\frac{k}{(n/2)^2}\\\\m_{\\text{new}}&=4\\frac{k}{n^2}\\\\m_{\\text{new}}&=4m.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 25
      },
      {
        "id": "p12-q12-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$n$ when $m$ is multiplied by $16$?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$n$ is divided by $4$, retaining its sign.",
          "worked": "Since $mn^2=k$,\n$$\\begin{align*}16m\\,n_{\\text{new}}^2&=mn^2\\\\n_{\\text{new}}^2&=\\frac{n^2}{16}\\\\|n_{\\text{new}}|&=\\frac{|n|}{4}.\\end{align*}$$\nOn the same-sign branch, $n_{\\text{new}}=\\frac n4$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 27
      },
      {
        "id": "p12-q12-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$n$ when $m$ is divided by $9$?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$n$ is tripled, retaining its sign.",
          "worked": "Since $mn^2=k$,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac m9\\,n_{\\text{new}}^2&=mn^2\\\\n_{\\text{new}}^2&=9n^2\\\\|n_{\\text{new}}|&=3|n|.\\end{align*}$$\nOn the same-sign branch, $n_{\\text{new}}=3n$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 27
      }
    ]
  },
